345	5	0	Application Support Manual\n\nOverview\n\nThis document is the Application Support Manual for the L1 Operation Analyst project. It provides comprehensive, operational guidance for support engineers to monitor, diagnose, remediate, and escalate incidents across the pipeline that integrates upstream systems (Mainframe, Informatica, Salesforce) with downstream systems (Snowflake, AWS Data Lake / S3, Athena, Salesforce). It covers environment setup, runbooks for common failure types, database and knowledge-base management, monitoring and alerting, security, maintenance, and appendices with ready-to-use commands and SQL.\n\nSupported Systems\n\nUpstream systems\n\nMainframe ÔÇö batch file exports (fixed width, CSV) delivered to landing S3 buckets.\n\nInformatica ÔÇö ETL jobs that push curated datasets to S3 or Snowflake.\n\nSalesforce (upstream) ÔÇö CRM exports (CSV/JSON) that feed enrichment pipelines.\n\nDownstream systems\n\nSnowflake ÔÇö cloud data warehouse for analytics and reporting.	[0.00026186425,-0.028724488,-0.023357747,-0.030329581,-0.008592261,-0.006134163,0.032217845,-0.021470051,-0.018290874,0.0015444363,0.053113613,0.015369733,0.009435788,0.14547658,0.009500148,-0.027638646,0.024370603,-0.0014282648,-0.09474658,0.01012024,0.0067202477,0.009950044,0.009571316,-0.012372624,0.036776967,0.010427933,-0.019193022,0.0588695,0.0027627952,0.004166646,0.03076775,-0.034785077,0.018168624,-0.013740832,2.359472e-06,-0.030853186,-0.045333385,-0.009597204,-0.0825982,0.012097429,0.017629793,-0.072438814,-0.012058204,0.03120746,0.00885536,0.06191109,0.06096887,0.025779061,0.054137494,-0.027333371,-0.013628589,0.04593835,-0.02659403,0.010369196,-0.039520394,0.022376569,-0.00498409,0.054816417,0.032945655,-0.03843474,0.020121776,-0.02914216,-0.0071111503,-0.0052630035,0.0010480334,0.028760277,0.023830032,-0.024842134,-0.043085553,-0.03137491,0.037803024,-0.0038654658,-0.010363842,-0.0050855028,-0.048988912,-0.058790214,-0.0062088966,0.00567856,0.037129927,-0.0254666