350	5	5	Remediation\n\nAdd missing library to requirements.txt and rebuild package.\n\nFor Lambda, create/update a Lambda Layer and attach.\n\nFor Glue, add library to job parameters or use an S3 wheel path.\n\nPost-mortem\n\nUpdate deployment checklist and CI packaging to include dependency verification.\n\n2. Python libraries version mismatch\n\nSymptoms\n\nAttributeError, TypeError, or runtime incompatibilities.\n\nImmediate checks\n\nInspect pip freeze or package versions in runtime environment.\n\nCheck requirements.txt and lockfile.\n\nRoot cause checks\n\nConflicting transitive dependencies.\n\n\n\nDifferent environments (dev vs prod) using different versions.\n\nRemediation\n\nPin versions in requirements.txt or use a lockfile.\n\nRebuild and redeploy with consistent versions.\n\nPost-mortem\n\nAdd automated dependency checks to CI.\n\n3. Code compilation issues\n\nSymptoms\n\nSyntaxError, NameError, or compile-time exceptions.\n\nImmediate checks\n\nRun linter/static analysis locally.\n\nCheck the failing line in logs.\n\nRemediation	[0.041583385,0.041813347,0.0010597493,-0.06535497,0.035252944,0.016142815,-0.022364125,0.005449516,-0.012929559,-0.04530486,0.0300522,0.05938907,0.04148029,0.033197876,-0.018732047,-0.007679645,-0.041923493,0.013657366,-0.07073535,0.01991019,0.015425124,0.061734382,0.014537868,0.012682703,0.024402754,-0.01512079,0.018812604,0.022323126,-0.0011140539,0.007852443,0.053075746,-0.042941954,0.0026034354,0.03485215,2.2709776e-06,-0.008300932,0.008897323,0.024130857,0.014365353,-0.029086966,0.041250885,-0.04580321,0.027519308,0.039547633,0.0033073893,0.043477453,-0.06260371,0.025877645,0.021258662,-0.0008069558,0.035741694,0.07853494,0.03508254,0.022379857,-0.0038548822,-0.073292814,0.017931003,0.044751506,0.061887164,-0.062001966,0.035832766,0.039363626,0.0020988344,0.006027158,-0.043581836,0.01665631,-0.06079328,-0.050473128,-0.0023615148,0.01096188,0.0074573075,-0.045013227,-0.049230445,0.0032832795,-0.031029308,-0.026040347,0.0386