351	5	6	Run linter/static analysis locally.\n\nCheck the failing line in logs.\n\nRemediation\n\nFix code, run unit tests, redeploy.\n\nPost-mortem\n\nAdd pre-deploy linting and unit tests.\n\n4. File landed with wrong extension\n\nSymptoms\n\nIngestion job fails to parse file; event filter mismatch.\n\nImmediate checks\n\nInspect S3 object key and extension.\n\nCheck S3 event notification filter configuration.\n\nRemediation\n\nMove file to correct bucket or update ingestion to accept extension.\n\nNotify upstream owner to correct export process.\n\nPost-mortem\n\nAdd validation Lambda to reject unsupported extensions and notify upstream.\n\n5. SNS and Lambda integration failure\n\nSymptoms\n\nSNS shows delivery failures; Lambda not invoked.\n\nImmediate checks\n\n\n\nCheck SNS subscription status and CloudWatch logs.\n\nVerify Lambda function is enabled.\n\nRoot cause checks\n\nIAM permissions for SNS to invoke Lambda.\n\nEndpoint configuration and subscription confirmation.\n\nRemediation	[-0.0017974195,-0.008560796,0.00308427,-0.034403346,0.04255804,-0.011842335,-0.036606368,-0.006265166,-0.04039169,-0.018156575,-0.012998136,0.07852625,0.031003185,0.0573011,-0.053869918,0.05258291,-0.008354376,0.025853673,-0.014043953,-0.005707409,0.011707554,0.031541355,0.024541784,-0.02486686,0.025986426,0.031128846,-0.017019222,0.025914747,-0.018840965,-0.014684061,0.02701344,-0.033942744,0.022219023,0.009613691,1.6718112e-06,-0.04874796,0.0086112395,0.008713825,-0.029071849,-0.0119294785,-0.02158725,-0.04835861,-0.018016892,0.02694111,-0.008069966,0.009359463,-0.029361796,0.043193348,0.027342752,0.055302784,-0.009563406,0.075120546,0.005981031,-0.0042327545,0.018500281,-0.042774413,0.019060006,0.023176955,0.03606723,0.009307923,0.0073224553,-0.033622228,-0.023761485,0.02559072,-0.029304786,0.016702207,-0.02052735,-0.054967817,0.0103611555,-0.0373354,0.06815609,0.036139935,-0.068404116,-0.029199459,-0.06494091,-0.036886863,0.02182993,-0.04657441,0.04483998,0.013459289,-0.0131