356	5	11	ORDER BY distance\n\nLIMIT 5;\n\nImage handling for architecture docs\n\nStore images in /docs/images/ or S3 and reference via image_path (preferred). Avoid storing binary in DB unless necessary.\n\nMonitoring, Logging, and Alerts\n\nLogging\n\nCentralize logs in CloudWatch (or local file system for simulation).\n\nEnsure Glue/EMR, Lambda, and application logs are retained for at least 30 days.\n\nMetrics and alerts\n\nFile arrival failures: alert when expected file not received within SLA window.\n\nJob failures: alert on Glue/EMR job failures or repeated retries.\n\nHigh latency: alert when Athena queries exceed threshold.\n\n\n\nKB ingestion failures: alert when embedding generation fails.\n\nSuggested alert channels\n\nPagerDuty or Slack for critical incidents.\n\nEmail for informational alerts.\n\nSNS for automated notifications.\n\nRunbook for alerts\n\nTriage severity (P0ÔÇôP3).\n\nAssign L1 owner.\n\nFollow the relevant runbook above.\n\nIf unresolved within SLA, escalate to L2.\n\nTroubleshooting and Diagnostics	[0.026597492,-0.042702965,-0.012450588,-0.014830289,0.027627852,-0.01789683,0.020008096,-0.024525078,0.020356044,0.030340793,0.029484948,0.039019234,-0.037251502,0.10267648,-0.021749897,-0.022824315,0.006014672,0.008455443,-0.07485423,-0.046560533,-0.01182893,-0.0019316663,0.014646066,-0.051429752,0.008217575,-0.024957385,-0.027837358,0.06404924,0.03656671,-0.04083574,-0.08054591,-0.018010912,-0.019727306,0.005583612,2.0084199e-06,-0.04132526,0.0031497302,-0.009443705,-0.0514972,0.020437209,0.060691994,-0.08433346,-0.0053821118,0.009734289,-0.004621153,-0.023719333,0.022678405,-0.0047052773,0.107434474,-0.023789458,-0.008258722,0.019628458,-0.03936659,-0.025971463,-0.051577408,-0.02643136,-0.009432411,-0.0031454437,0.03327582,0.010256171,0.024194652,0.022577025,0.030847965,0.006384237,0.046465147,0.06270577,-0.03849936,-0.040381223,-0.052693345,-0.06366156,0.071556434,-0.025644602,0.0139592495,0.017632952,-0.05824514,-0.008162625,0.00529398