320	2	0	Application Flow Manual\n\nOverview\n\nThis document describes the end-to-end application flow for the L1 Operation Analyst project. It details how data moves from upstream systems through the ingestion and processing pipeline into downstream systems, how agents interact with the knowledge base, and the operational controls required to keep the pipeline healthy. The manual is written for engineers, L1 analysts, and system operators who will run, monitor, and troubleshoot the system.\n\nComponents\n\nCore AWS Simulation Components\n\nS3 ÔÇö landing and processed buckets for raw and transformed data.\n\nSNS ÔÇö event notification for object creation and pipeline events.\n\nLambda ÔÇö lightweight validation, orchestration, and trigger logic.\n\nGlue ÔÇö ETL jobs for schema transformation and catalog registration.\n\nEMR ÔÇö Spark processing for heavy transformations and ML workloads.\n\nAthena ÔÇö ad hoc SQL queries over S3 processed data.\n\nSnowflake ÔÇö downstream data warehouse for analytics and reporting.	[-0.003061191,-0.023708468,-0.031842247,-0.038020063,-0.035887368,-0.01821456,-0.0031557768,-0.038975254,-0.031320628,0.00421599,0.06338104,0.05831196,0.033027846,0.13906547,-0.009268057,-0.02205008,0.0173368,-0.01007154,-0.095705345,0.016998805,0.007276202,0.0012949597,0.009615549,-0.0152730765,0.027083183,0.022167535,-0.043174274,0.042138707,-0.0130940145,0.016106667,-0.00021942226,0.0028455418,0.021162957,-0.012563153,2.1383469e-06,-0.03514138,-0.021186214,0.013944697,-0.07505909,0.0029396757,0.034538474,-0.03614923,0.005598527,0.048384294,0.007914567,0.056609135,0.042870298,0.009971603,0.045341615,-0.026123159,-0.02186591,0.00041932764,-0.023598637,0.038828332,-0.012333421,-0.0015813202,0.015211583,0.01763354,0.038692836,-0.03346458,-0.0072591137,-0.012192409,0.013629172,-0.0074573434,0.027064698,0.03653406,-0.006720765,-0.024827415,-0.060198024,-0.03230785,0.06227324,-0.004561873,0.0067419372,0.013099228,-0.048303414,-0.06864384,-0.018762592,-0.00277