321	2	1	Snowflake ÔÇö downstream data warehouse for analytics and reporting.\n\nPostgres with pgvector ÔÇö knowledge base storing incidents, RCAs, and embeddings.\n\nAgents ÔÇö Analyzer, Validator, Escalator orchestrated by LangChain or equivalent.\n\nUpstream Systems\n\nMainframe ÔÇö batch exports delivered as fixed width or CSV files.\n\nInformatica ÔÇö scheduled ETL jobs that push curated datasets.\n\nSalesforce ÔÇö CRM exports in CSV or JSON format.\n\nDownstream Systems\n\nSnowflake ÔÇö final analytics store.\n\nAWS Data Lake ÔÇö S3 processed layer and Glue catalog.\n\nSalesforce ÔÇö downstream updates for enriched records.\n\nEnd to End Flow\n\nThis section describes the canonical sequence of events from file arrival to downstream availability and KB update.\n\nSequence Overview\n\nFile Arrival\n\nUpstream system writes file to S3 landing bucket.\n\nS3 generates an ObjectCreated event.\n\n\n\nEvent Notification\n\nS3 event publishes to SNS topic configured for the bucket and prefix filters.\n\nLambda Validation\n\nSNS triggers Lambda.	[-0.0065053166,-0.054823127,-0.03938637,-0.02496031,-0.053947277,0.00014264506,0.0042075645,-0.024655974,-0.020646265,0.005800854,0.0602131,0.009329095,0.027725399,0.14182055,0.0063209115,-0.038067963,0.029695107,0.033147424,-0.07691109,0.009826653,0.024493596,0.005529795,0.0025595454,-0.01698165,0.060617775,-0.00911077,-0.0540217,0.04841809,-0.038159754,-0.013693024,-0.011025469,-0.0070317993,0.009898713,0.015728552,1.8524457e-06,-0.04737176,-0.0129239205,-0.0061557954,-0.044629205,0.028113348,-0.0062801456,-0.057640117,-0.007725051,0.0142205125,0.0016801135,-0.006421914,0.052570183,0.031232039,0.039575562,-0.022304198,-0.024494298,-0.0018931653,-0.009182929,0.031658713,-0.01292691,0.0026549015,0.007749652,0.038235717,0.02264234,0.005198032,0.0058584986,-0.025741095,-0.0061455877,-0.014580204,0.023292243,0.039419726,0.04876875,-0.056029696,-0.06624652,-0.026632326,0.05291611,-0.048962258,0.00045700115,-0.008100209,-0.048670724,-