322	2	2	Lambda Validation\n\nSNS triggers Lambda.\n\nLambda performs lightweight validation: file extension, schema header check, file size threshold.\n\nIf validation fails, Lambda writes a failure event to a monitoring topic and optionally moves file to quarantine bucket.\n\nOrchestration\n\nOn successful validation, Lambda triggers Glue job or EMR step with job parameters (S3 path, schema, partition keys).\n\nProcessing\n\nGlue or EMR executes ETL/Spark job: parse, transform, enrich, write processed data to S3 processed bucket and register partitions in Glue catalog.\n\nJobs emit logs and metrics to CloudWatch or local log store.\n\nCatalog Registration\n\nGlue job updates Glue Data Catalog with table schema and partitions.\n\nIf partition discovery is required, run MSCK REPAIR TABLE or explicit partition registration.\n\nDownstream Load\n\nProcessed data is loaded into Snowflake via Snowpipe or bulk copy, or made available to Athena for ad hoc queries.\n\nMonitoring and KB Update	[0.0032060482,-0.08816019,-0.011330967,-0.038768362,-0.016354151,-0.0013732073,0.0006439534,-0.053351387,-0.02306676,0.016881589,0.0017711554,0.05592791,0.05604503,0.07541318,-0.02081511,-0.011660086,0.012565731,0.018884202,-0.061040815,-0.019265639,0.0024938309,0.030150414,0.0037164772,0.002552115,0.0049198866,-0.0055822358,-0.041098915,0.077730134,-0.023612607,0.0017632296,-0.04414387,0.005240618,0.009152849,0.0032371522,1.6610741e-06,-0.05727468,-0.0071354033,-0.004301287,-0.0073318426,0.028165843,-0.006331066,-0.03393042,-0.022495326,0.027644841,-0.0018728477,-0.0011028955,0.027936421,0.012087569,0.048202157,0.0062858174,-0.01740215,0.048327148,-0.041380055,0.026074244,-0.0075408993,-0.034344256,0.02151891,0.0058319266,0.03193257,-0.033616524,-0.0046068057,-0.013464969,-0.011665481,-0.016755618,0.0089996755,0.040883202,-0.018079365,-0.09410415,-0.009187031,-0.066461176,0.060966376,-0.06123313,-0.012368715,0.0068741785,-0.011253971,0.04003755,0.0043719322,-0.037221394,0.063090585,0.0