323	2	3	Monitoring and KB Update\n\nIf job fails, logs are captured and an incident record is created in Postgres KB.\n\nAnalyzer Agent generates an RCA draft using KB semantic search and stores the draft in the KB.\n\nValidator Agent reviews and marks validated or escalates.\n\nEscalator Agent notifies L2 or downstream owners via email, Slack, or ticketing system.\n\nTextual Sequence Diagram\n\nCode\n\nMainframe/Informatica/Salesforce -> S3 Landing\n\nS3 Landing -> SNS Topic\n\nSNS Topic -> Lambda Validator\n\n\n\nLambda Validator -> Glue/EMR Trigger\n\nGlue/EMR -> S3 Processed\n\nGlue -> Glue Catalog\n\nS3 Processed -> Athena / Snowflake\n\nGlue/EMR -> Logs -> KB Incident Creation\n\nKB -> Analyzer Agent -> RCA Draft\n\nRCA Draft -> Validator Agent -> Validated or Escalate\n\nEscalate -> L2 / Ticketing / Slack\n\nData Contracts and Event Schemas\n\nS3 Event Notification Filter Example\n\njson\n\n{\n\n  "Records": [\n\n    {\n\n      "eventVersion": "2.1",\n\n      "eventSource": "aws:s3",\n\n      "s3": {	[0.025249539,-0.04243414,-0.0075520934,-0.027888056,-0.026930263,-0.011193977,-0.03714161,0.010760438,-0.023030186,-0.012740918,0.07034534,0.06906767,-0.036473844,0.13384546,-0.04395329,0.012145178,0.01663187,0.03707193,-0.02838769,0.020996492,0.026242532,0.04446555,0.007515394,0.017209271,-0.009795965,0.037090037,-0.052626487,0.015606195,0.03812779,-0.03731759,-0.022488026,0.008759959,0.029345397,0.028088987,1.9616862e-06,-0.05102215,-0.015262255,-0.010716859,-0.055690266,0.03656971,-0.038351066,-0.06133159,-0.012533547,0.01376814,-0.026887184,0.020491453,0.0037702003,0.07704956,0.067201264,0.004182899,-0.013586609,0.016266229,-0.019829748,-0.010658551,-0.013131655,-0.062452752,0.025616992,-0.029416895,0.008859905,0.006107263,0.019004602,0.0007713858,-0.014576761,-0.056493137,0.018901685,-0.0059137763,0.008217407,-0.035274338,-0.018581882,-0.07016247,0.05904035,-0.034410693,0.02670967,-0.0053413436,-0.025103431,-0.010535168,0.017505702,-0.015382326,-0.0027463313