328	2	8	High query latency: alert when Athena queries exceed threshold.\n\nKB ingestion failure: alert on repeated embedding generation failures.\n\nSuggested Alert Channels\n\nCritical: PagerDuty or oncall Slack channel.\n\nHigh: Team Slack channel and email.\n\nMedium: Email and ticket creation.\n\nDeployment and CI CD\n\nSource Control\n\nKeep Glue scripts, EMR bootstrap scripts, Lambda code, and SQL DDL in Git.\n\nTag releases and maintain deployment branches.\n\nCI Steps\n\nLint and unit tests for Python code and Spark jobs.\n\n\n\nBuild Lambda deployment package and Docker images if used.\n\nIntegration tests using a staging S3 bucket and test Glue jobs.\n\nDeploy via IaC (CloudFormation, Terraform) or scripted CLI.\n\nRollback Strategy\n\nMaintain previous stable Glue job script and Lambda package.\n\nIf new deployment causes failures, revert to previous version and open a rollback incident.\n\nSecurity and Access Control\n\nIAM Best Practices\n\nUse least privilege for Lambda, Glue, and EMR roles.	[0.0112609295,-0.063747086,-0.02245827,-0.07809748,0.01111161,-0.010501584,0.0015250006,-0.01707158,0.0007072955,0.058195222,0.026116202,0.07343888,0.025001748,0.12145752,-0.013066766,-0.022441616,-0.017911816,0.0029033879,-0.08708014,-0.0008354467,-0.01584494,0.008687557,-0.0073461398,-0.015774217,0.016493587,-0.0040710107,-0.029086074,0.042590357,0.02000343,-0.0022343462,-0.04050538,-0.02083264,-0.037867058,0.008799364,1.8054797e-06,-0.019005751,0.011257146,0.0053793723,-0.0073819305,0.015542485,0.020761197,-0.06465991,0.013407579,0.031348605,-0.013477934,0.016080821,0.0024714896,-0.013126362,0.09639695,-0.010789156,0.004721347,0.024594666,-0.029044908,-0.0056347274,-0.022313839,-0.05204246,-0.013973008,0.008759683,0.052112263,-0.0072829206,0.029830476,-0.0026794074,0.01028342,0.022113122,0.018936502,0.0640695,-0.031130632,-0.089331545,-0.01491188,-0.06639152,0.098932624,-0.055668604,-0.025851995,0.029200178,-0.026272664,0.026619349,0.002055693,-0.026807973,0.073