330	2	10	Performance Tests\n\nLoad test Glue/EMR jobs with large files and measure scaling behavior.\n\nTest embedding generation throughput and Postgres vector search latency.\n\nTroubleshooting Playbook\n\n\n\nIf file never triggers pipeline\n\nCheck S3 event configuration and SNS subscription.\n\nVerify object key prefix and suffix filters.\n\nConfirm SNS topic has active subscription to Lambda.\n\nIf Lambda fails to invoke Glue\n\nVerify Lambda IAM role has glue:StartJobRun permission.\n\nConfirm Glue job name and arguments passed by Lambda.\n\nIf Glue job fails with library errors\n\nCheck job Python library path and wheel locations.\n\nFor EMR, verify bootstrap actions installed required jars and Python packages.\n\nIf Athena queries fail\n\nVerify Glue catalog schema matches S3 data.\n\nRun MSCK REPAIR TABLE or ALTER TABLE ADD PARTITION.\n\nIf KB semantic search returns poor matches\n\nConfirm embedding model dimension matches incident_embeddings.embedding vector size.\n\nRe-seed embeddings after changing model.	[0.017505387,-0.066926345,0.00028215148,-0.04230607,0.04187378,-0.011569113,-0.011188275,0.014282227,0.00042538796,0.024791662,0.03293843,0.058310557,0.014156661,0.105905116,-0.024967961,0.012481885,0.025655318,0.037585355,-0.048111945,0.007897559,-0.032734755,0.033643372,0.009604794,-0.019152422,-0.010180222,0.046741508,-0.066314235,0.0363253,-0.0077847433,-0.021415701,-0.058012355,-0.008411293,-0.010700579,0.028653368,2.0839225e-06,-0.046653066,0.021609144,0.008528241,-0.015107986,0.044567373,0.033029445,-0.044636086,0.0076325857,0.0265578,-0.03066174,-0.0114706075,-0.037021503,0.01480746,0.04576427,0.026492015,-0.012746688,0.06129269,-0.04161821,-0.04453948,0.028399266,-0.037732165,0.00274968,0.0030211813,0.06575464,-0.010042089,0.02972662,-0.011127031,0.011925624,0.026231451,0.011182762,0.07266795,0.005957894,-0.054675005,0.009095307,-0.051923957,0.054046087,-0.0155188,-0.021426573,-0.021392027,-0.03155849,0.045274008,0.032253746,-0.022882883,0.05