333	3	0	Project Architecture Flow Manual\n\nOverview\n\nThis document describes the project architecture for the L1 Operation Analyst system. It explains components, integration points, data flows, and operational controls. The manual is written so architects, SREs, L1/L2 engineers, and technical writers can reproduce diagrams, embed them into a formal document, and use the content as the authoritative architecture reference.\n\nArchitecture Diagrams\n\nBelow are the required diagrams, each with a clear purpose, a detailed visual specification, and step-by-step guidance for creating the diagram in a word processor or diagram tool. Insert each diagram at the indicated location in the document and include the provided caption and alt text.\n\nDiagram 1 Overview Architecture\n\nPurpose High-level system map showing upstream systems, ingestion pipeline, processing layer, knowledge base, agents, and downstream systems.\n\nVisual elements\n\nUpstream systems (three icons): Mainframe, Informatica, Salesforce.	[-0.0009367002,-0.02254891,-0.042885803,-0.0008204039,-0.036080543,0.0059958347,0.008096917,-0.045596693,-0.019719103,-0.002969511,0.012351256,0.008670441,0.019050216,0.13760124,-0.0050139986,-0.040787764,0.004024478,-0.0029956386,-0.112919785,0.01695999,0.0043686195,-0.00738598,0.014422433,0.012663754,0.017061831,0.011060649,-0.05714824,0.03329438,-0.03537188,-0.0282405,0.011148751,0.000183272,0.034507494,-0.03231808,2.2976308e-06,-0.0205604,-0.023669185,0.007290825,-0.07835859,0.036534626,0.026081422,0.004153957,0.012094167,0.024967164,0.03289275,0.01851503,0.044820875,0.061063007,0.039365806,-0.012948501,-0.0053559863,-0.029404163,-0.050768655,-0.0117265135,-0.073490344,-0.05102406,0.016339386,0.043025672,0.018061949,-0.0046610804,-0.025827296,-0.0103632575,0.012813355,-0.006567375,0.029949786,-0.020670682,0.06353549,-0.040387735,-0.016405517,-0.001268895,0.07389879,0.046161715,0.007048241,0.019870052,-0.021294905,-0.08809679,-0.016741637,-0.032852545,0.024771027,-