340	3	7	EMR\n\nPurpose: heavy Spark workloads and ML processing.\n\nInstance sizing: tune executor memory and cores; use spot instances for cost optimization.\n\nKnowledge Base\n\nPostgres with Vector Extension\n\nSchema: incidents, incident_embeddings, architecture_docs.\n\nEmbedding column: vector(N) where N equals model dimension.\n\nBackup: regular dumps and offsite storage.\n\nAgents\n\nAnalyzer\n\n\n\nInputs: logs, error messages.\n\nOutputs: draft RCA with confidence score.\n\nValidator\n\nInputs: draft RCA and evidence.\n\nOutputs: validated RCA or feedback.\n\nEscalator\n\nInputs: validated RCA.\n\nOutputs: ticket creation, notifications.\n\nData Flow and Sequence Diagrams\n\nProvide textual sequence diagrams and sample payloads to include alongside visuals.\n\nSequence Diagram Text\n\nCode\n\nUpstream -> S3 Landing: upload file\n\nS3 Landing -> SNS: publish event\n\nSNS -> Lambda: invoke validation\n\nLambda -> Quarantine: move if invalid\n\nLambda -> Glue/EMR: start job if valid\n\nGlue/EMR -> S3 Processed: write output	[-0.021185078,-0.057642236,-0.008889803,-0.011191031,-0.017557135,0.035594527,-0.0015635025,-0.015227615,-0.049429186,-0.0016876288,0.09343587,0.08532636,-0.0124479905,0.14225495,0.005451491,-0.022561401,0.0004229468,0.01781854,-0.0005174032,0.027025826,0.01719683,0.038642492,0.012418433,0.024283176,-0.0019798123,0.016688028,-0.06654328,0.030658258,0.042133357,-0.03568869,-0.025963176,-0.019466046,0.041558865,0.03973316,2.0542338e-06,-0.01803938,-0.025326917,0.019047331,-0.037585903,0.01897447,0.0010778448,-0.059946686,0.037370957,0.038016025,0.031754557,0.00086322636,0.02168911,0.06386322,0.054228675,0.021504136,-0.017296467,-0.014321544,-0.014598203,-0.0043222127,-0.0139959995,0.0061662844,0.015643032,0.0026807887,0.023006776,-0.010995652,-0.020575058,-0.033803124,0.015681244,-0.018606218,0.036020737,0.032309327,0.017566243,-0.02723209,-0.04062131,-0.047721118,0.06309915,-0.03341659,0.027474865,0.0006918667,-0.052974835,-0.01985304,0.011