341	3	8	Lambda -> Glue/EMR: start job if valid\n\nGlue/EMR -> S3 Processed: write output\n\nGlue -> Glue Catalog: update schema and partitions\n\nS3 Processed -> Athena: queryable data\n\nGlue/EMR -> Logs -> KB: create incident on failure\n\nKB -> Analyzer: semantic search and draft RCA\n\nAnalyzer -> Validator: submit draft\n\nValidator -> Escalator: validated RCA triggers ticket\n\nEscalator -> L2: notify and attach evidence\n\nExample Event Payload\n\nS3 event: bucket, key, size, etag, metadata.source_system.\n\nLambda validation result: status, errors[], recommended action.\n\nGlue job arguments: S3 input path, S3 output path, partition keys, schema version.\n\nDeployment and Operations\n\nThis section covers deployment patterns, CI/CD, monitoring, and runbook integration.\n\n\n\nCI/CD Recommendations\n\nStore Glue scripts, Lambda code, and SQL DDL in source control.\n\nUse automated pipelines to build and test artifacts.\n\nDeploy via IaC templates or CLI scripts to ensure repeatability.\n\nMonitoring and Observability	[0.014677488,-0.07236426,-0.0032616844,-0.054328248,-0.006370272,-0.0049644317,0.017978063,-0.04561377,-0.02446338,0.031187192,0.019440036,0.0825051,0.039753824,0.120190024,-0.032057367,-0.022313341,0.012622375,0.01737733,-0.075547606,-0.0062221903,-0.007325332,0.030779308,-0.0044421065,-0.008959564,0.011218478,0.021769356,-0.039639685,0.060046166,0.0022976007,-0.0037566929,-0.011271789,-0.00909374,-0.007095331,-0.01300521,1.7321944e-06,-0.056484267,-0.005246778,0.005588787,-0.030245578,0.035006277,-0.017450558,-0.030049259,0.00034311975,0.020348117,-0.013532158,0.018893937,0.02041829,0.0037053206,0.077577315,-0.010366951,-0.004619272,0.032408867,-0.035041127,-0.005084005,4.2106603e-05,-0.031294283,0.006289282,0.029569063,0.041281886,-0.017682452,0.01747088,-0.031646002,-0.0038182188,0.0099907825,0.030013364,0.030845126,-0.024456803,-0.08676352,-0.0100126825,-0.08345685,0.08270778,-0.061095227,-0.0066953455,0.028071737,-0.032174278,0.0011046585,-