342	3	9	Deploy via IaC templates or CLI scripts to ensure repeatability.\n\nMonitoring and Observability\n\nLogs: centralize in CloudWatch or equivalent.\n\nMetrics: job success rate, job duration, KB ingestion latency, embedding generation throughput.\n\nAlerts: missing file SLA, repeated job failures, KB ingestion errors.\n\nBackup and Recovery\n\nPostgres: scheduled dumps and retention policy.\n\nS3: lifecycle rules and cross-region replication for DR.\n\nGlue/EMR: keep job definitions in version control for quick redeploy.\n\nAppendix\n\nProvide assets descriptions, diagram creation tips, and a checklist for finalizing the document.\n\nDiagram Asset Descriptions\n\nFor each diagram include:\n\nTitle: short descriptive title.\n\nPurpose: one sentence.\n\nElements: list of icons and labels to include.\n\nAnnotations: text to place near arrows or decision points.\n\nSuggested caption: one line for the figure caption.\n\nAlt text: short accessibility description.\n\nDiagram Creation Tips	[0.01602878,-0.015930317,-0.023899974,-0.075204045,-0.027712919,0.0056316443,0.040741086,-0.063745335,-0.014808952,0.018469123,0.0673262,0.053535428,0.0077204313,0.108359195,0.016735982,-0.024448423,-0.010665701,0.018551836,-0.096304975,0.01967214,0.0048955865,0.02837277,0.0012061764,0.0018369993,-0.055244327,-0.0012784586,-0.06339559,0.04936398,-0.004569611,-0.056065403,-0.025995746,0.010843944,0.000631504,0.0025183398,2.0408863e-06,-0.023303287,-0.03694931,0.016831454,-0.03992728,0.038458925,0.042207975,-0.07502937,0.007149187,-0.015627801,0.053209174,0.014545902,0.06622639,0.037466105,0.08273241,-0.035629854,-0.0017721665,0.0004360102,-0.06708014,-0.033657577,-0.05568844,0.0002175042,-0.009708622,0.05608732,0.021632416,-0.009012875,0.023349833,0.0147705395,-0.0018004009,0.00629494,0.06144244,0.015323428,0.012997724,-0.06865667,-0.032325514,-0.022106783,0.11402271,-0.013891383,0.0032894977,0.02735923,-0.023835905,0.016983753,-0.035121694,-0.01700785,0.08041734,-0.042970993,-0.0560