363	5	18	Appendix C ÔÇö Quick checklist for new incidents\n\n\n\n[ ] Confirm file arrival in S3.\n\n[ ] Check SNS delivery and Lambda invocation.\n\n[ ] Inspect Glue/EMR job logs.\n\n[ ] Query Athena for processed data.\n\n[ ] Search KB for similar incidents (semantic search).\n\n[ ] Draft RCA and mark validated when confirmed.\n\n[ ] Escalate if unresolved within SLA.\n\nFrequently Asked Questions\n\nQ: How do I change the embedding model later A: Update the model in seed_embeddings.py, note the new dimension, alter incident_embeddings.embedding to vector(new_dim), and re-seed embeddings.\n\nQ: Where to store architecture images A: Place images in /docs/images/ or S3 and reference via image_path in architecture_docs.\n\nQ: How to add new runbooks A: Add a new section under Runbooks with Symptoms, Checks, Remediation, and Post-mortem steps. Commit to repo.\n\nFinal notes\n\nKeep this manual versioned in the project repository under /docs/Application_Support_Manual.docx (or .md for source).	[0.01276396,-0.026028134,0.0087560695,0.005517416,0.044533826,0.004682621,0.04072967,-0.03939691,-0.013063634,0.0009676768,0.036415797,0.05663386,-0.0030151408,0.11935468,0.01588512,-0.01051108,0.035883117,0.010253113,-0.027378732,-0.014306899,-0.024017693,0.022875866,0.0492765,-0.022357482,-0.012240777,-0.010851222,-0.049091607,0.046065092,-0.0133726755,-0.056534193,-0.014053407,-0.034125865,0.03554787,0.019809417,2.5777779e-06,-0.03693976,-0.0023303472,0.018662706,-0.034662638,0.08780372,0.046855424,-0.046575665,-0.017083826,0.019271348,-0.018374873,-0.04223235,0.0019736167,0.041794166,0.07667739,-0.002599609,-0.01581296,0.03385999,-0.029835604,-0.032590844,0.0025489223,-0.011272077,-0.008828972,0.02999932,0.0027069473,-0.001957149,0.0029323308,0.012503452,0.0051934533,0.025355244,0.06013061,0.06279806,-0.007650051,-0.058861285,-0.00945111,-0.036945835,0.075435914,0.0034804067,-0.00015564343,0.018759955,-0.056126576,-0.021354008,-0.007947795,-0.037046015,0.052676905,-0.015842358